<p class="greeting">Your account has been locked</p>
<p class="intro">
  Hello {{firstName}}, your BackOffice NG account has been temporarily locked
  after <strong>{{attempts}} failed login attempts</strong>.
</p>

<div class="info-card">
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Account</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{email}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Locked at</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{lockedAt}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Unlocks at</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{unlocksAt}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="info-row">
    <span class="info-label">Last attempt IP</span>
    <span class="info-value">{{ip}}</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="">
  🚨 If this was not you, your account credentials may be compromised.
  Contact your administrator immediately.
</div>

<div class="btn-wrap">
  <a href="{{forgotPasswordUrl}}" class="btn danger">Reset My Password</a>
</div>